depending on your perspective.

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:12.970
And the green line is
what actually happened.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.540
So we reached 50 times
of actual traffic,

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:19.350
and there was a need for the
data storage and other systems

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.210
to perform well at that scale.

